rectory> --breaking-only"},{"text":") it fails only when a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference is breaking, so CI can check the events against the base branch’s plan.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Run it with "},{"code":"iglu","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the Iglu vendor of the app’s schemas, the kind of registry and a directory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"swift run AppTrackingPlan iglu com.acme server Iglu","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), or pass "},{"code":"--iglu-vendor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"--iglu-registry","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the "},{"code":"export-tracking-plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin, to write the plan’s events as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schemas of an Iglu registry, for a Snowplow pipeline to validate them against, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" writes them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is an executable of the app’s own because only a program that links the app’s event types"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds their schemas: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan()"},{"type":"text","text":" finds the events of the modules it links."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/files(carryingForward:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/files(carryingforward:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan’s files, as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","isActive":true},{"type":"text",